# tbag-fufu -- known-legitimate globals for the wow-lint W113 (undefined-global) sweep.
# These are NOT auto-detected by addon-tools/wow-lint (they are assigned indented inside
# if-blocks / functions, or are intentional existence-checks), so list them here to keep a
# luacheck run showing ONLY real removed/moved-API candidates.
#
# Run over the FULL gameplay .lua set (cross-file globals like TFuInv_cmd /
# TFuBnkTabSettings_Open are only resolved when their defining file is included):
#   addon-tools/wow-lint/luac5.1-wow.ps1 <all gameplay .lua files> -ShowAll
# Deliberately NOT listed (keep them visible): genuine removed/absent APIs.
# The former undeclared-local leaks (button idx playerid s1 s2 tmpcalc
# instruction_count) were FIXED 2026-06-01, so a clean full-set sweep now shows
# W113 = 0. One expected W143 remains by design: C_TradeSkillUI.GetAllRecipeIDs
# (absent on retail 12.0) is existence-checked in Professions.lua with a
# GetFilteredRecipeIDs() fallback -- guarded, not a bug.

